{"4657720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Clickerite", "steam_appid": 4657720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clickerite is an incremental mining game where you must collect materials, craft powerful tools, and battle evil monsters in a cube-dimensional world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a <i>cube-dimensional</i> world where you will destroy cubes to collect materials and craft items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select a cube and start <i>clicking</i> to get its materials!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Base Camp</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your materials to upgrade the camp and build all kinds of structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657720/extras/68c39cf102343315b45dcf753efd7561.poster.avif?t=1785872336\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657720/extras/68c39cf102343315b45dcf753efd7561.webm?t=1785872336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657720/extras/68c39cf102343315b45dcf753efd7561.mp4?t=1785872336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting tools and Enchantments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft tools to boost productivity and automate the gathering cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is crafting better tools not enough for you? Enchant them and unleash their full potential!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657720/extras/2257dfd0568c4b0fde206e7be216f04a.poster.avif?t=1785872336\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657720/extras/2257dfd0568c4b0fde206e7be216f04a.webm?t=1785872336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657720/extras/2257dfd0568c4b0fde206e7be216f04a.mp4?t=1785872336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your ultimate weapons to take on the enemies of this world, featuring unique<i> clicker</i> mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657720/extras/e6db6885ddb4c334df89db2a31b64d60.poster.avif?t=1785872336\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657720/extras/e6db6885ddb4c334df89db2a31b64d60.webm?t=1785872336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657720/extras/e6db6885ddb4c334df89db2a31b64d60.mp4?t=1785872336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various biomes where you will find materials of all kinds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill tree with click, automation, and gathering upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build other structures, such as the <strong>mine</strong>, to automatically collect random materials, or the <strong>port</strong>, to trade with travelers.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clickerite is an incremental mining game where you must collect materials, craft powerful tools, and battle evil monsters in a cube-dimensional world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a <i>cube-dimensional</i> world where you will destroy cubes to collect materials and craft items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\